<title>USA: Dialogic Corp Q3 profit falls on charge.</title>
<headline>Dialogic Corp Q3 profit falls on charge.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						     September 30,</p>
<p>					     1996     %     1995     %</p>
<p> Revenues			     $55,432  100.0 $44,029  100.0</p>
<p> Net income			     4,793    8.7   4,929   11.2</p>
<p> Income per share (1)		  0.29	     0.31</p>
<p>Shares used in the calculation</p>
<p>	 of income per share	 16,400	   15,965</p>
<p>			   (In thousands except share amounts)</p>
<p>							 Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>							   September 30,</p>
<p>					   1996	%	1995     %</p>
<p> Revenues			   $154,218  100.0 $120,466  100.0</p>
<p> Net income			   19,971   13.0   10,993    9.1</p>
<p> Income per share (1,2,3)	   1.22		0.69</p>
<p>Shares used in the calculation</p>
<p>     of income per share	  16,387	    15,983</p>
<p>NOTE: (1) 1996 Q3 includes $1.0 million or $0.04 per share of one-time licensing fees related to Syntellect Patent Portfolio.</p>
<p>(2) Q2 1995 includes $1.3 million or $0.05 per share of merger costs related to Spectron Microsystems acquisition.</p>
<p>(3) Q1 1996 includes $9.1 million or $0.35 per share of gain on the sale of VCS shares.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
